{"step_index":104,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T10:42:08Z","thinking":"**Prioritizing Tool Specificity**\n\nI'm focusing intently on tool specificity. I've been refining my approach to avoid unnecessary use of bash commands for file creation or appending, opting for dedicated tools like `>` and `>>` respectively. I am also working to use `grep_search` more for searching, rather than general grep commands. I must remember to use the more efficient tools.\n\n\n**Clarifying Risk-Reward**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on integrating a clear explanation of \"RR Target\" within the app. I'm thinking of adding an explanation in Mandarin, potentially quoting from \"Jack Investment\" about the 1.5x risk-reward ratio. This would go into the `stock_screener.py` file, likely within a Streamlit expander or just after the summary. This should make the app more user-friendly.\n\n\n**Defining RR Target**\n\nI'm making progress on the Streamlit app. I'm adding an expander, written in Mandarin, near the status legend. The expander explains the \"RR Target\" concept. I'm including a quote from \"Jack Investment\" about the 1.5x risk-reward ratio, aiming to clarify the meaning of \"Reached 1:1.5 RR Target\". This should greatly improve user comprehension.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Add an explanation for the 1:1.5 RR Target in Mandarin, quoting the Jack Investment book.\"","EndLine":"112","Instruction":"\"Insert a new expander explaining the RR Target below the existing Status Legend expander.\"","ReplacementContent":"\"with st.expander(\\\"ℹ️ Status Legend (Click to expand)\\\"):\\n    st.markdown(\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    - 🟢 **BUY SIGNAL**: All criteria met for a new entry (Trend is up, volume surge, breakout).\\n    - 🟡 **WATCH (Consolidating)**: Stock is pulling back to support, waiting for breakout.\\n    - 🟡 **HOLD**: For stocks you already own; trend is still intact.\\n    - 🔴 **SELL SIGNAL**: Trend is broken or the stock hit your Cut Loss (CL) level.\\n    - 🟢 **TAKE PROFIT**: Stock has reached your Take Profit (TP) target.\\n    - ⚪ **NO SIGNAL / IN TREND**: No actionable setup right now.\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\")\\n\\nwith st.expander(\\\"📖 什么是 1:1.5 RR Target？ (What does RR Target mean?)\\\"):\\n    st.markdown(\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    **RR (Risk-Reward Ratio / 盈亏比)** 是交易中最核心的资金管理概念之一。当你在状态栏看到 **\\\"Reached 1:1.5 RR Target\\\"** 时，代表这支股票的当前价格，已经达到了预设的 1.5 倍获利目标，系统提示你应该 **TAKE PROFIT (主动止盈)**。\\n\\n    ### 📘 摘自《Jack Investment》第17章（资金与仓位管理）：\\n    > *\\\"我个人通常建议，每笔交易至少要具备 1.5 倍以上的盈亏比——如果亏的话会亏 100 块，那你就要确保赚的时候会赚到至少 150 块。在这样的盈亏结构下，一笔 1.5 : 1 的交易，你只需要约 40% 的胜率，就能达到长期不亏不赚的损益平衡点。\\\"*\\n\\n    **App 是如何计算的？**\\n    1. **Risk (风险/潜在亏损)** = `Entry Price (你的买入价)` - `Cut Loss (止损支撑位)`\\n    2. **Reward (回报/盈利目标)** = `Risk × 1.5`\\n    3. **TP Target (止盈目标价)** = `Entry Price` + `Reward`\\n\\n    一旦股价达到这个 **TP Target**，就意味着你已经赚取了冒着风险换来的 1.5 倍回报。根据 Jack 的策略，此时你应该选择卖出 50%-70% 的持股来锁定利润 (Lock in profit)，剩余的持股则可以继续放着，通过移动止盈 (Trailing Stop) 去捕捉更大的涨幅！\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\")\"","StartLine":"103","TargetContent":"\"with st.expander(\\\"ℹ️ Status Legend (Click to expand)\\\"):\\n    st.markdown(\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    - 🟢 **BUY SIGNAL**: All criteria met for a new entry (Trend is up, volume surge, breakout).\\n    - 🟡 **WATCH (Consolidating)**: Stock is pulling back to support, waiting for breakout.\\n    - 🟡 **HOLD**: For stocks you already own; trend is still intact.\\n    - 🔴 **SELL SIGNAL**: Trend is broken or the stock hit your Cut Loss (CL) level.\\n    - 🟢 **TAKE PROFIT**: Stock has reached your Take Profit (TP) target.\\n    - ⚪ **NO SIGNAL / IN TREND**: No actionable setup right now.\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\")\"","TargetFile":"\"C:/Users/wai_j/.gemini/antigravity/brain/c155f291-512d-4565-8630-f27b8bc949d1/stock_screener.py\"","TargetLintErrorIds":"[]","toolAction":"\"Patching code\"","toolSummary":"\"Add RR explanation in Mandarin\""}}]}
{"step_index":105,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T10:43:11Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-23T18:43:11+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-23T18:43:11+08:00\nThe following changes were made by the replace_file_content tool to: C:\\Users\\wai_j\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\c155f291-512d-4565-8630-f27b8bc949d1\\stock_screener.py. If relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission.\n[diff_block_start]\n@@ -145,6 +145,21 @@\n     - ⚪ **NO SIGNAL / IN TREND**: No actionable setup right now.\n     \"\"\")\n \n+with st.expander(\"📖 什么是 1:1.5 RR Target？ (What does RR Target mean?)\"):\n+    st.markdown(\"\"\"\n+    **RR (Risk-Reward Ratio / 盈亏比)** 是交易中最核心的资金管理概念之一。当你在状态栏看到 **\"Reached 1:1.5 RR Target\"** 时，代表这支股票的当前价格，已经达到了预设的 1.5 倍获利目标，系统提示你应该 **TAKE PROFIT (主动止盈)**。\n+\n+    ### 📘 摘自《Jack Investment》第17章（资金与仓位管理）：\n+    > *\"我个人通常建议，每笔交易至少要具备 1.5 倍以上的盈亏比——如果亏的话会亏 100 块，那你就要确保赚的时候会赚到至少 150 块。在这样的盈亏结构下，一笔 1.5 : 1 的交易，你只需要约 40% 的胜率，就能达到长期不亏不赚的损益平衡点。\"*\n+\n+    **App 是如何计算的？**\n+    1. **Risk (风险/潜在亏损)** = `Entry Price (你的买入价)` - `Cut Loss (止损支撑位)`\n+    2. **Reward (回报/盈利目标)** = `Risk × 1.5`\n+    3. **TP Target (止盈目标价)** = `Entry Price` + `Reward`\n+\n+    一旦股价达到这个 **TP Target**，就意味着你已经赚取了冒着风险换来的 1.5 倍回报。根据 Jack 的策略，此时你应该选择卖出 50%-70% 的持股来锁定利润 (Lock in profit)，剩余的持股则可以继续放着，通过移动止盈 (Trailing Stop) 去捕捉更大的涨幅！\n+    \"\"\")\n+\n def resolve_ticker(query, market):\n     try:\n         url = f\"https://query2.finance.yahoo.com/v1/finance/search?q={query}&quotesCount=3&newsCount=0\"\n[diff_block_end]\n\nPlease note that the above snippet only shows the MODIFIED lines from the last change. It shows up to 3 lines of unchanged lines before and after the modified lines. The actual file contents may have many more lines not shown."}
{"step_index":106,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T10:43:11Z","content":"I have just updated the app! If you refresh the page at **http://localhost:8501**, you will see a new dropdown section right below the status legend titled: **\"📖 什么是 1:1.5 RR Target？\"** \n\nI've put a detailed explanation inside the app itself, but to answer your questions directly:\n\n### 1. Why 1:1.5 RR and how is it calculated for CIMB?\nIn Chapter 17 of the Jack Investment book (资金与仓位管理), he emphasizes the concept of Risk-Reward (盈亏比):\n> *\"每笔交易至少要具备 1.5 倍以上的盈亏比——如果亏的话会亏 100 块，那你就要确保赚的时候会赚到至少 150 块。\"*\n\nIf you bought CIMB at **$7.41**, the app calculates the safety net (Cut Loss) based on recent support levels. Let's say the recent support was **$7.00**.\n*   **Your Risk (亏损风险)** = $7.41 - $7.00 = **$0.41**\n*   **Your Reward Goal (盈利目标)** = $0.41 × 1.5 = **$0.615**\n*   **Your TP Target** = $7.41 + $0.615 = **$8.025**\n\nIf CIMB reaches $8.025, the app will flag it as **🟢 TAKE PROFIT** because you hit your 1:1.5 goal. It means it's time to **sell some of your stock** (usually 50%-70%) to lock in the profits safely (主动止盈).\n\n### 2. What does \"SELL SIGNAL\" mean?\nA **🔴 SELL SIGNAL** means you need to **SELL to cut your losses or protect your capital**. You should **never stock up more (越跌越买)** when you see this signal. \n\nIn Jack's strategy, if a stock hits a Sell Signal, it means either:\n1.  **Hit Cut Loss:** The price fell below the support box.\n2.  **Trend Broken:** The price fell below the EMA 30 moving average, meaning the short-term uptrend has died.\n\nAs Jack mentions in Chapter 16 (鳄鱼效应 / Alligator Principle), when the market goes against you, you must cut your losses swiftly before it drags your entire portfolio down!"}
